@title The Cave

You stand at the mouth of a cave. [[Go in]](entrance) or [[walk away]](home).

[[entrance]]:
It's dark. You can go [[left]](left tunnel), go [[right]](right tunnel), or [look around].

[look around]:
@set torch
You find an old torch, and it still works.

[[left tunnel]]:
A narrow passage. [[Keep going]](lake) or [[go back]](entrance).
{{#if torch}}[[Climb up]](ledge){{/if}}

[[right tunnel]]:
Bones everywhere. [[Run!]](lake), or [[search]](treasure room).

[[lake]]:
An underground lake. [[Swim]](drowned), [[go around]](treasure room) or [[call out]](echo).

[[treasure room]]:
@end
Gold! You win.

[[drowned]]:
The water is too cold.

[[home]]:
@end
You go home. Nothing happens.

[[ledge]]:
From up here you can see the lake.
{{embed "lake"}}

[[old notes]]:
Nothing links here yet.
